&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; closely with the Equity Operations leader and cross-functional stakeholders to provide accurate, timely information that supports decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
